{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段影片，直擊銅鑼灣發生一幕險象環生的過路情節。事發於英皇道與永興街交界，一名婆婆推著四輪助行車過馬路期間，疑因反應遲緩，停留在路中心等待過路時機。由於現場車來車往，情況相當危險。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">期間，一名疑似正在送外賣的單車手見狀，隨即由對面逆線駛至，並向來車揚手示意截車，全程護送婆婆安全離開馬路範圍。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-09h59m49s634.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026CTqo31YOk31785120188.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-09h59m49s634.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-09h59m59s891.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026ywMY5EQU731785120188.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-09h59m59s891.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-10h00m02s201.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026S0nhPUewKz1785120188.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-27-10h00m02s201.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後隨即引發網絡討論，不少網民對婆婆的危險行為表示擔憂，關切其身體狀況：「係咪有腦退化？」、「阿婆可能有認知問題。」此外，更有認出該名婆婆的網民透露：「呢個婆婆成日都係喺呢個位過馬路。」</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">另一方面，對於單車手的救援舉動，網民一方面指其十分熱心，但同時亦指出逆線衝出馬路護送同樣存在一定危險性：「咁衝出馬路隨時自己都比（被）人撞飛，引起連鎖意外，今次只係<strong> d </strong>車好彩冷靜停得切。」 、「佢咁樣都好危險，好彩冇事。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T03:18:51.727630+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}